      "writtenOn": "2018-03-30T18:50:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In short, charge termination enabled + battery absence \u003d EC boot loop: VBUS plunges, making VSYS glitches...\n\nAnyway, yea, I see battery_is_present() be called frequently in charger_task(). But I don\u0027t want board_charge_termination() to make more calls to battery_is_present(). However, if you\u0027re fine with these additional calls, I can do that and remove the static variable.",
